  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kiwany Paulö kïngölonöy ompö kokwonay pö Areopako, kïwe Atene kutang kanasayanta Korinto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtuyeghö wöloni chi pö Yaudi nyo kikuro Akwila nyo kikïyichï Ponto, nyo kitökungwïno koro Talyan nko korkenyi Prisila, ompöwölo kimwa pöytoghintö Klaudio keyon pipö Yaudi löwïr kïpegha Rumi. Kiwö nyu Paulö kïrutochï chane ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akumpur nko chane akïpöghisyö tïkwïl ompöwölo ki nöpinto emen nyite le chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep kegh ompö asispa Sapato* anka tïkwïl nko chane ompö kö pö saghat* kumukyini kïngwïsu pipö Yaudi nko Krik kïcham kughan ngalechini kyomtoy nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kituna Sila nko Timoteo Makedonia, kwamta Paulö kïtenö asis ngölyonto Yeso, akunetöy pipö Yaudi lö, Yeso nyinte nyo le Kristo.* ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kipech kumöl nyinte akumwa kïparta terïtyon ompö sïrokachi akïlenchï ompö ngal cho nïkisöch, “Ato opotyekwa ompöwölo mi Tororöt, kï akwane kegh cho onyoru kighechin! Megheghchinanïnye chi. Kïngeta ye kikowan omchinotö pipö punton.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpïstö chane akïwö kïtöpö nko chi nyo kikuro Tito Yusto, nyo kisoghöy Tororöt, nyo kiriköy kegh konyi nko kö pö saghat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kighan Echotyon Krispo nko konyi tïkwïl, aki wowïn pö kö pö saghat nyinte. Kïlïm pikö walaka cho chang ompö Korinto ngölyonto Paulö, akughan, akepatisan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsïwa oghe anka Paulö ngongut kimwochini Echotyon nyinte lö, “Mewöghisyö ngalananyi, amesis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ompöwölo omitan nko nyi. Möminye chi nyo muköy kwighunyi nyo gha ompöwölo chang piköchan ompö kanasyantanetenyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona, kumpur Paulö kanasyantanay köny akonga nko aro mut nko akonga, akunetöy pich ngölyonto Tororöt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kilïkwï Kalio kirwokinto Akaya, kïngetytï pipö Yaudi Paulö akumït tawu Kalio tökerwokï ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïlentöy, “Kökïnkïn chichï pich kïsagh Tororöt ompö or nyo töghöy kirurut!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kimököy Paulö kïngölonöy, kïlenchï Kalio pïchay pö Yaudi, “Ntö kökïgh nyo kalel anta nyo gha nyï kegh chichï, köterwokwa, we pipö Yaudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ato paraku ngal nko kaynötut cho pö kirurutkökwa, omwoghan lö arosa akwane. Molïkunanye mutinto ngal cho lata choni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutulö pïchay köyay pö kirwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnam chane lapay Sostene nyo kile wowïn pö kö pö saghat, akemungö nyinte köyay pö kirwok. Wölo kimöyangnye Kalio nyonikïny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamïla Paulö Antiokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 6:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïkany kïmala ngalechona, kïtöpö Paulö Korinto nko kighönï osis cho chang, atolapay kïpïstö chane akïweghö meli nko Prisila nko Akwila kutang Sirya. Kirwach Paulö mötïnyi kïtomö kïweghö kanasyanta Kenkrea ompö muma nyo kyam ompö tawu Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa ntökwit Epeso, kïpökochï wölini Prisila nko Akwila. Kïwö kïlït kö pö saghat akïwechï kïteptep kegh ngal nko pipö Yaudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsagh nyinte kumpur nko chane osis cho chang, wölo kimöchamnye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kiwetöy kïlenchï chane, “Ato machata Tororöt, orutoghwokwa ngat.” Kïngeta Epeso kïweghö meli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kitïta Kaysaria, kïpus kutang Yerusalem kutakwes pipö kanisa, atolapay kïwö kutang Antiokia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kumpur wöloni osis cho te, kïwö kuwerata koro Kalatia nko Prukia, kukilotoy ompö wöloni kighönï lapay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mi Apolo Epeso nko Korinto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitï chi pö Yaudi anka Epeso nyo kikuro Apolo, nyo pö Aleksandria. Ki chi nyo ngöghom, aki chi nyo kinkït kïngalan akipköchinote Kikirut nyoman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökikenet nyinte ngala Ara Echotyon, kutor kïngalan akunet lasiny ngala Yeso, ompö mïkulöwunyi. Wölo kinkït chichoni kipatisanata Yoana kïpoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
