              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutor kïngalan ompö nyakanat ompö kö pö saghat. Kïkany kïlïm Prisila nko Akwila ngalechi, kumït nyinte kïwö katangwa akuporchï nyinte lasiny ara Tororöt ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi Apolo kunonöy kwoghyö nanam kutang Akaya, kungarak nyinte cho kighönï cho kimi Epeso kukirchï kighöni cho kimi Akaya kïlenchï, “Atacha nyinte ompö wöloni.” Nyini kitïta, kïlïkwï nyinte kingörokut nyo wow ompö pich cho kisyonchï Tororöt kïsïch kighanat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kilot pipö Yaudi nyoman ompö tawu pich otini kiporchini chane ompö Kikirut lö, Yeso nyo le Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.28"
            ]
          }
        }
